Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.58,0:02:19.67,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}40分後
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.05,0:02:49.00,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}翌朝\N5時
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.92,0:03:31.43,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}5月27日\N事故から2日後
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.62,0:04:23.37,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}1988年10月6日\N最初の事件から4か月半後
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.80,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}翌朝\N6時20分
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.18,0:05:16.10,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}午前7時37分\N捜索開始から1時間後
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.62,0:06:55.90,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}肋骨が出てた
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.27,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}翌日
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.52,0:08:23.13,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}10月9日\N午前8時半ごろ\N2人目の事件から3日後
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.38,0:08:37.97,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}正午
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.12,0:09:31.17,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}午後3時半
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.17,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}1頭だと考える根拠
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.32,0:11:24.67,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}複数だと考える根拠
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.18,0:14:05.77,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}はっきりしていること
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.50,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fs78\fad(250,200)}深い傷になりやすい
